ROLE OF ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE

A Smart Placement Portal can be further improved using Artificial Intelligence.

An AI-based recommendation system can analyze a student's skills, academic performance, projects, certifications, interests, and resume. Based on this information, the system can recommend suitable job opportunities.

For example, a student with skills in Python, SQL, Machine Learning, and Data Analysis may receive recommendations for positions such as:

Data Analyst
Python Developer
Junior Machine Learning Engineer
Business Analyst

AI can also be used for resume analysis and job matching, helping students discover opportunities that closely match their profiles.

SECURITY AND PRIVACY

Since the portal handles important student and company information, security is an essential part of the system.

The portal should provide:

Secure authentication
Role-based access control
Password protection
Data validation
Secure document storage
Protection of student information
Controlled access to recruiter and placement data

Students should only be able to access their own personal information, while placement officers and recruiters should have access according to their assigned roles.

