CONCLUSION

The Smart Placement Portal provides a centralized and efficient solution for managing campus recruitment activities.

By replacing manual processes with an automated digital platform, the system can save time, reduce paperwork, minimize errors, improve communication, simplify recruitment, and provide better placement opportunities for students.

With the integration of Artificial Intelligence, data analytics, and automation, the Smart Placement Portal can become more than just a placement management system.

It can evolve into an intelligent career-support platform that connects students with suitable opportunities and helps educational institutions achieve better placement outcomes.

